    {
      "heading": "Objectives",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Find Zho, Talon Silverwing, Panaku, and Lo Sha in Jaya Bluffs. Destroy the plague creatures that have overrun the monastery. See Zho for your reward."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reward",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "2,000 Experience 100 Gold"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Walkthrough",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Head out into Jaya Bluffs and go northwest, fighting hostile Tengu along the way. When you reach Zho and company, there will be three groups of Afflicted in a small monastery, the Sizhou Hall on a tall island. Eliminate them and claim your reward."
      ]
    },
