        "Afflicted (3 random)",
        "14 (24) Afflicted Warrior 14 (24) Afflicted Ranger 14 (24) Afflicted Monk 14 (24) Afflicted Necromancer 10 (24) Afflicted Mesmer 10 (24) Afflicted Elementalist 14 (24) Afflicted Assassin 12 (24) Afflicted Ritualist"
